Subject: [PATCH] Adapt RTL8821CS vendor driver to Linux 7.2

Update kbuild flags, timer/string and cfg80211 APIs, PPPoE header access,
and rename the private SHA256 helper that conflicts with the kernel.
The firmware and power-state/recovery logic are unchanged.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [compatibility with SenkOS Linux 7.2]

